05:04:11,860 --> 05:04:16,814
most of the time we update data through our tables, but there are times that you may

3357
05:04:16,814 --> 05:04:20,294
not have direct permission to a table for security reasons.

3358
05:04:20,294 --> 05:04:25,801
So your only option is to modify data through a view. In those cases, you can use

3359
05:04:25,801 --> 05:04:30,832
your views to insert, update, or delete data, assuming that your views are

