05:04:30,832 --> 05:04:36,406
updatable. We'll look at security and permissions later in the course. In the last

3361
05:04:36,406 --> 05:04:42,117
lecture, you'll learn about the updatable views. Now following the same example from

3362
05:04:42,117 --> 05:04:47,827
the last lecture, let's see what happens when we update the payment total for one of

3363
05:04:47,827 --> 05:04:53,062
these invoices. So here we have invoice 2, the payment total is less than the

3364
05:04:53,062 --> 05:04:54,014
invoice total.

3365
05:04:54,014 --> 05:04:59,755
We have a balance, and that is the reason we have this invoice in this view. Now I'm

3366
05:04:59,755 --> 05:05:05,223
going to update this invoice through this view, and set the payment total to the

