3376
05:05:50,671 --> 05:05:54,254
this. Back to the code for this view. At the very end,

3377
05:05:54,254 --> 05:05:59,883
after our select statement, we type with check option. When we apply this clause,

3378
05:05:59,883 --> 05:06:05,512
this view will prevent, update, or delete statements from excluding rows from the

3379
05:06:05,512 --> 05:06:10,654
view. Let me show you. So I'm going to recreate this view by executing the

3380
05:06:10,654 --> 05:06:16,213
statement. Alright, now let's go back to our view. Let's update another invoice,

3381
05:06:16,213 --> 05:06:21,912
invoice number 3. Here we don't have a payment, so back to our query window, let's

