06:28:18,935 --> 06:28:26,388
store database. So we start a transaction and give customer number 1 10 extra

4308
06:28:26,388 --> 06:28:34,519
points. So update, customers, set points to points plus 10, where customer id equals

4309
06:28:34,519 --> 06:28:42,456
1. And then we commit. Now don't execute this yet, let's copy this entire code and

4310
06:28:42,456 --> 06:28:48,845
paste it into our new session. Let me zoom in, alright, beautiful.

4311
06:28:48,845 --> 06:28:55,807
Now before executing this script, let's look at the customers table and see how many

4312
06:28:55,807 --> 06:29:02,685
points customer number one has. So, here's the customers table, customer number one

