06:30:22,854 --> 06:30:29,196
changes. Alright, now, let's go to the second session, update is no longer running,

4330
06:30:29,196 --> 06:30:35,232
so it affected one row, but the changes are not committed yet. Let's commit the

4331
06:30:35,232 --> 06:30:41,420
changes. Alright, now, back to our customers table, let's refresh the result, and

4332
