07:18:07,962 --> 07:18:12,899
For example, clothes can have a size and color, but things like a TV have other

4906
07:18:12,899 --> 07:18:17,837
specs like weight, dimension, and so on. So it's not a good idea to add several

4907
07:18:17,837 --> 07:18:22,899
columns in this table where only a subset of these columns apply to each product.

4908
07:18:22,899 --> 07:18:27,962
This is where we can use JSON to easily store multiple key value pairs about each

4909
