5469
08:04:35,048 --> 08:04:39,660
So far we have done a lot of work on this physical data model. But before we go

5470
08:04:39,660 --> 08:04:44,272
ahead and generate our database tables, we need to make sure that our design is

5471
08:04:44,272 --> 08:04:49,176
optimal and doesn't allow redundant or duplicated data. Because redundancy increases

5472
08:04:49,176 --> 08:04:54,021
the size of our database and complicates the insert, update, and delete operations.

5473
08:04:54,021 --> 08:04:58,750
For example, if the name of someone is repeated in many different places and they

