08:05:03,128 --> 08:05:08,183
Otherwise we'll have inconsistent data and this is bad because it gives us invalid

5476
08:05:08,183 --> 08:05:13,115
reports. So that's where normalization comes to the rescue. Normalization is the

5477
08:05:13,115 --> 08:05:18,231
process of reviewing our design and ensuring that it follows a few predefined rules

5478
08:05:18,231 --> 08:05:23,163
that prevent data duplication. There are basically seven rules also called seven

5479
08:05:23,163 --> 08:05:28,156
normal forms and each rule assumes that you have applied the previous rules. Now,

