5704
08:23:45,604 --> 08:23:51,232
That brings me to my next point. Don't model the universe. We'll talk about that

5705
08:23:51,232 --> 08:23:57,141
next. One of the mistakes that a lot of data modelers make is they try to generalize

5706
08:23:57,141 --> 08:24:02,980
