5708
08:24:08,467 --> 08:24:14,165
happen. So they end up creating a model that is overly complex and in my opinion,

5709
08:24:14,165 --> 08:24:19,582
useless. In one of the companies that I worked at before, we had one of these

5710
08:24:19,582 --> 08:24:20,074
