like relationships, relationship types, and so on. So he essentially built a

5725
08:25:24,568 --> 08:25:29,548
relational database on top of a relational database. This design is referred to as

5726
08:25:29,548 --> 08:25:34,286
the sixth normal form. And while it may promise some benefits on the paper, in

5727
08:25:34,286 --> 08:25:39,266
reality, it creates a big mess that nobody can clean up. That is the reason I told

